{"turn":2,"units":[
{"unitId":"blue-1","x":1960,"y":1680,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":600,"morale":80,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Aubry has no new order and holds his line south of the river, facing the bridge. Nothing comes within sight."},
{"unitId":"blue-2","x":2140,"y":1680,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":550,"morale":75,"fatigue":0,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Delacroix has no new order and keeps his line beside the 1st Battalion. Nothing comes within sight."},
{"unitId":"blue-3","x":2050,"y":1800,"facingDeg":0,"formation":"line","strength":200,"morale":85,"fatigue":28,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[{"orderId":"b3-6","result":"carried-out"}],"account":"Maj. Verneuil gets his order a little after the third minute. From where he stands he can already see two columns on the road to the north, with a screen of horse in front of them. He rides west round the end of the screen to the open ground below the northern wood, sees the head of a column at about 600 m, and turns back before the enemy horse can cut him off. He re-crosses the river by the bridge and reports to the infantry.","departure":"Projection has the squadron ride 600 m north to (2100,750), straight at the enemy columns and in the face of their screen, and stay there idle. Verneuil's order is to reconnoitre towards the northern wood, not get caught, and bring back the news, so he skirts the screen to the west, looks, and returns to the south bank, ending 1 km from the projected position and more tired."},
{"unitId":"red-1","x":1900,"y":650,"facingDeg":180,"formation":"column","strength":650,"morale":80,"fatigue":2,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Brandt has no new order and keeps his column where it is. He glimpses horse far off to the west but his own screen is between him and it."},
{"unitId":"red-2","x":2150,"y":550,"facingDeg":180,"formation":"column","strength":650,"morale":70,"fatigue":2,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[],"account":"Col. Hartmann has no new order and halts his column where he is, by the book."},
{"unitId":"red-3","x":1750,"y":950,"facingDeg":250,"formation":"loose","strength":220,"morale":85,"fatigue":14,"ammo":100,"status":"active","continuing":{"kind":"hold"},"orders":[{"orderId":"r3-6","result":"carried-out"}],"account":"Maj. von Reiter shifts his screen west and south to keep himself between the enemy horse and the columns when he sees it ride out to the west. He does not charge: his order is to screen and not to be drawn on. The enemy gets a sight of the head of one column, but no more, and then goes back.","departure":"Projection keeps the hussars at (2050,1000) holding. The enemy horse moves round the screen's flank, so von Reiter moves 300 m to the west to stay between it and the columns, which is more than the 100 m tolerance."}
],
"observations":[
{"side":"blue","by":"blue-3","unitId":"red-3","when":"start"},
{"side":"blue","by":"blue-3","unitId":"red-1","when":"start"},
{"side":"blue","by":"blue-3","unitId":"red-2","when":"start"},
{"side":"red","by":"red-3","unitId":"blue-3","when":"start"}
],
"summary":"A quiet turn of manoeuvre. Blue-3, on the north bank east of the road, saw both Red columns and the hussar screen at the start of the turn. On its order to reconnoitre towards the northern wood he rode west round the end of the screen, got a sight of the head of a column at about 600 m, and withdrew over the bridge to Blue's lines. Red-3 shifted west to keep itself between him and the columns but did not charge, in keeping with its orders to screen and not to be drawn on. No fire or melee. The infantry on both sides held. The projection's idle advance of the Blue cavalry into the Red screen was replaced by the withdrawal."}
